// acceptanceCommands.jsonc — ONE frozen -build line per plugin (materialise) and one --rebridge line (debug judge)
// (SPEC-bridgeFramework-v1.md §7.4, §14.1; RULINGS R1, 12:05 #3): the three-run replay protocol holds ONLY under the
// frozen command, because the relationship block carries nodes with embeddings (--vectorize, the embedding cache and
// the hub build are inputs to R1). Every command PINS --decisionStoreFilePath explicitly (RULING 12:05 #3): the store is
// otherwise derived beside the standardsDatabase and a fresh scratch DB per run reads as "no decision block" and mimics
// a replay defect. null-and-honest in B2 — the B3 / B4 builders freeze the lines from their first accepted runs.
// A frozen id compared against a run with a different flag set is a broken test, not a failed gate.
